    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Season of War (Beta) is a dynamic 2D arcade RPG/twin-stick shooter RPG with an individually developed combat system from SinorCreate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will find an exciting combination of two genres, where the variability of pumping and abilities is combined with fast, reactive battles that require strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ideal for those who are looking for dynamic gameplay and want to &quot;kill time&quot;, enjoying pleasant 2D graphics with an unusual perspective, atmospheric music and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game requires immediate strategic decisions, and the gradual discovery of abilities and battles with interesting bosses will make the passage unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the moment, the game is short: there is no plot, and only 5 missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, Season of War is constantly improving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In 2025, the plot will be rebuilt and filmed, and in 2026, the game will be replenished with a significantly larger number of missions and will be released in full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Season of War (Beta) is a dynamic 2D arcade RPG/twin-stick shooter RPG with an individually developed combat system from SinorCreate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will find an exciting combination of two genres, where the variability of pumping and abilities is combined with fast, reactive battles that require strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ideal for those who are looking for dynamic gameplay and want to &quot;kill time&quot;, enjoying pleasant 2D graphics with an unusual perspective, atmospheric music and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game requires immediate strategic decisions, and the gradual discovery of abilities and battles with interesting bosses will make the passage unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the moment, the game is short: there is no plot, and only 5 missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, Season of War is constantly improving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In 2025, the plot will be rebuilt and filmed, and in 2026, the game will be replenished with a significantly larger number of missions and will be released in full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
